      en: {"q":"Which forms of company are NOT entered in the company register? Select all that apply.","o":["Silent partnership","Civil-law partnership (GesbR)","Limited partnership (KG)","Cooperative","Flexible corporation (FlexKapG)"],"e":"The silent partnership and the GesbR are not entered in the company register – the silent partnership is even invisible to outsiders. KG, cooperative and FlexKapG must register."},
